{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "coverageGaps": [
    "The root error boundary has no deterministic public trigger.",
    "The valid password-reset token form is not photographed because its bearer token would otherwise enter the capture URL provenance; reset request confirmation and invalid-token handling are captured.",
    "A valid device-authorization code cannot be created through a supported public fixture; the missing-code state is captured.",
    "Notes create and delete interactions are not separate screenshot states; the real notes API and create flow are exercised by functional E2E.",
    "Chat transport error UI is not deterministic under the shipped echo profile; the real streamed conversation state is captured.",
    "The visual matrix captures the shipped disabled jobs profile. Enabled empty, pending and failure screenshots are not declared; the full Docker lane verifies real succeeded output and authorization.",
    "Native screenshots cover the signed-out browser host only; a packaged Tauri app and authenticated native bearer flow are not run."
  ],
